## Proposed Changes

### 1. Fix SWR Update Quickness (Stale State)

#### [MODIFY] [RoomTickets.tsx](file:///c:/Users/REYANSH/OneDrive/Desktop/EXP_NEXT/expense_tracker/app/components/rooms/RoomTickets.tsx)
- Replace SWR-based decryption of page-1 tickets (`page1Decrypted` via SWR) with a React `useEffect` that listens directly to `swrData` changes. This bypasses SWR's 30-second deduplication cache, ensuring that whenever page-1 raw tickets are updated or revalidated, the decrypted list is immediately re-evaluated.
- Fix global key invalidation inside `handleDelete` to support array/tuple keys.

